  "body": "Current furnishings are not as depicted in photographs used for marketing purposes.\r\nSolid, substantial brick and tile family home situated on a sunny and spacious corner section in the very heart of the popular Red Beach community.\r\nThe imposing street presence will draw you straight to the formal entry and a well-designed ground floor area incorporating 3 bedrooms, bathroom, large formal lounge, large dining room, highly functional kitchen and larger than standard double garage.\r\nEasy flow from the dining and living areas immediately out on to a semi covered private outdoor courtyard, safely hidden behind a solid brick boundary fence. Perfect for relaxing and entertaining at any time of the day and the perfect area for children and pets to roam, with large lawn areas and established gardens framing the property. \r\nThe upstairs area is solely focused on a private master suite with generous walk-in robe, well-appointed ensuite and main bedroom with feature internal louvres. The perfect area to escape the hustle and bustle of the rest of the home to enjoy your own space.  \r\nPlenty of off-street parking and potential to refresh the home and make improvements. \r\n\r\nSet within one of Red Beach’s most serene and leafy green tree-lined streets, within walking distance to Kingsway, Silverdale Schools and Orewa College are nearby. A short drive to Silverdale Mall and motorways. And you'll enjoy the best of coastal living with nearby amenities and beautiful beaches.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this rare opportunity to make this exceptional property your own.  Vendors are committed to their next home, and our instructions are to sell this home.",
